@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy & data handling";
}
<h1 class="h3 mb-3">Privacy &amp; data handling</h1>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body">
    <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Injury reports are treated as <strong>protected health information (PHI)</strong>, even where not legally required.</li>
        <li>The narrative is encrypted in the database. All traffic uses HTTPS.</li>
        <li><strong>Anonymous reports</strong> store no account, email, IP address or exact time of submission.</li>
        <li>Reports by registered users are visible only to that user and to authorised SCA staff, and every staff access is recorded in an audit log.</li>
        <li>We never collect the injured person's name. Please don't write names, phone numbers or SCA membership numbers in the narrative.</li>
        <li>Statistics are computed on combined incidents and are exported without narratives or reporter details.</li>
    </ul>
</div></div>
